<<He>> shifts in the seat and breathes out through <<his>> nose. "After a bout like that last one, I go home and I can't sit still. Watching you on top of someone while the pill works on you." <<He>> glances at you. "You're good at it. Don't let anyone tell you different."<<arousal 200>><<garousal>><<colosseumHeat 1>>
